  "body": "Welcome to 1/6A Fenton Circus, a rare opportunity to secure a 262sqm (approx.) residence within one of Orakei’s most prestigious and sought-after enclaves. Set discreetly back from the road, this exceptionally private home offers a refined lock-up-and-leave lifestyle while still delivering the space families love, ideal for busy households.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by prestigious homes and the peaceful, park-like ambience of Fenton Circus, arriving home feels like entering your own sanctuary – sun drenched, secure and quiet. With multiple indoor and outdoor living zones, entertaining is effortless and relaxed days are made easy in the beautifully maintained outdoor setting framed by established planting.\r\n\r\nInside, comfort and versatility take centre stage. Accommodation is impressive featuring four generous, light-filled bedrooms and three modern bathrooms across two levels, the layout suits busy family life and visiting guests. The expansive master suite is a standout, complete with a walk-in robe and a stylish, fully tiled en-suite. Bathrooms enjoy added comfort with underfloor heating, while the entry-level bedroom, supported by a nearby bathroom is a superb choice for guests or extended family.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is the stylish, functional kitchen with premium appliances and a breakfast bar. Formal and family living are balanced with two spacious living areas plus a formal dining space ideal for every occasion designed to keep family and guests connected. An additional room can be tailored as a playroom/study/gym or flexible family zone - adapting as your lifestyle changes.\r\nPracticality and comfort are standout features throughout, with double internal-access garage, separate laundry, gas underfloor heating warming all wooden floors for year-round warmth.\r\n\r\nPositioned for lifestyle, you’re only minutes from the CBD, local beaches, and upmarket shopping. Close to Orakei Basin and local shopping with convenient access to the city. Zoned for Orakei School, Baradene and Selwyn Colleges. \r\n\r\nOpportunities to enjoy this level of privacy, space and lifestyle are rare\r\n\r\nSecure your place in one of Orakei’s most tranquil and prestigious pockets. Visit the open homes or contact me to arrange a private viewing. A pre-sale building report is available on request. \r\n\r\nAuction:  On Site 12:00p.m. Tuesday 8th December 2026 (unless sold prior).",
